OL,3,GNEWSAPumpkin named Bagheera breaks
OL,4,Aworld record
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pumpkin grower has set a new world
OL,7,Frecord after producing a giant squash.
OL,9,FIan Paton, from Lymington, Hampshire,
OL,10,Fentered his exceptionally large
OL,11,Fspecimen into a giant vegetable
OL,12,Fweigh-off near Reading in Berkshire.
OL,14,FIt weighed 2,856.8lbs (1,295.8kg), has
OL,15,Fcircumference of over 20ft (6m) and was
OL,16,Fofficially confirmed by Guinness World
OL,17,FRecords judge, Sebastian Suski.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
