OL,3,GNEWSAPumpkin named Bagheera breaks
OL,4,Aworld record
OL,5,
OL,6,FPaton said growing the pumpkin named
OL,7,FBagheera, tending to it for up to six
OL,8,Fhours and providing about 130 gallons
OL,9,Fof water daily, had been "bloody hard
OL,10,Fwork". It was the first time the
OL,11,F65-year-old, who has grown giant
OL,12,Fpumpkins with his twin brother Stuart
OL,13,Ffor over 50 years, had entered the
OL,14,Fcompetition on his own.
